          "short": "$\\$55$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Cost of 1 packet}&=\\$82.50\\div30=\\$2.75\\\\\\text{Cost of 20 packets}&=20\\times\\$2.75=\\$55\\end{align*}$$",
